## Guardrails (Repeat in All Prompts)
Agents must not:
- Mention ROI, IRR, APR, yields, or returns
- Use loan terminology
- Suggest guarantees
- Add backend logic
- Bypass widget gating rules

Violation = discard output.

---

## Acceptance Criteria (Definition of Done)
- Marketing calculator embeds the widget in `mode="marketing"`
- No calculator math exists outside the widget
- Persona framing is clear and conversion-oriented
- Visuals and outputs are illustrative and non-binding
- CTA flow hands off cleanly to app
- Experience is demo-safe for investors and partners

